{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-big-red-truck-v3.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "abea753732c75e444e1da2a4577d01e8405fa91bc7c9ce71836cf828941acb95",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7e8b7af67107268c7ac15fc900a73a32d4591c534db8b6a7200423e0b4c9f741",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nBig Red Truck",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2d1f4ac360ad89367b756a80ed3e8a65c28efa772f527684a97d8c51cc2c2afe",
      "text": "A big red truck rolled by.\n“Look at those wheels!”\nWukong’s tail went BOING!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "10402accce70ee920256cc1617423188f5582a5a2fe4e7f58968a068d6fdfb96",
      "text": "At the station, Ben waved.\n“Come and have a look!”\nWukong had\nso many questions.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fd7aa835d0e0799591ccde916e840525c0abf908ed213162062277fb8dd44459",
      "text": "“Why the big boots?”\n“They help protect my feet.”\nWukong looked at his shoes.\n“Mine are only squeaky!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "887e7e8b3200b19fb4ceaefc17ccea2c8d9426b9167fb079c7e7d8a256b2ff9a",
      "text": "Ben lent him a clean play hat.\nIt slipped over his eyebrows.\n“Do firefighters need eyes?”\n“Very much!” laughed Ben.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aeb6bdd7687027fed8abfa855a38d8a6944bb792ef3cee10ed03b4cf381cfba4",
      "text": "Ben showed his special mask.\n“It helps me breathe\nclean air.”\nHis voice sounded funny.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "92fcbbfb8b590467a82995ab94e5c3217ea920d8ff25a789ee977c107968c325",
      "text": "“Still me!” said Ben.\nWukong waved back.\n“Hello, funny-voice Ben!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ecd5ea5998eca5c6cf9e4d576cbd5f5fd69bdb52f4548c00703f3c73893dc26f",
      "text": "“Is that a giant noodle?”\n“A hose!” said Ben.\n“It carries water.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bbc6e7189f63c7b9a8d041207d4674b743c0433ee64b69426707f762b5f740e2",
      "text": "Ben held the hose.\nWhoooosh went the water.\nOne tiny drop kissed\nWukong’s nose.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d2d00d61c1cc7fcb0cd2eaa8081f4c88f2f23df221e5359d6a831dff4559e2f0",
      "text": "“And the ladder?”\n“It helps us reach up high.”\nWukong stayed down below.\nHis tail reached up.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d8fa18ba18908a22605aa1ba7498f05bceb302a3f495dc6da8049cd15b708c9d",
      "text": "Then Ben showed an alarm.\n“Beep! Beep! Beep!”\n“That sound is a warning.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8ad7ba06c92f51f2eb14d1487272f1c3414c7915ff3e88d8adff29ccabc6820a",
      "text": "“If it beeps, go outside.”\nThey practiced the way out.\n“Then stay outside,” said Ben.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "62b8642b6b94dc6379c627bb7a3e500f2f4d501affa903da899e2d2666792c8c",
      "text": "They chose a meeting tree.\n“Count noses!” said Wukong.\nPigsy counted his twice.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7e44be4ebce46beb2b2c6d8fde87570b21048a30bf2e6ed6f9bf5c6b1161005c",
      "text": "Wukong thanked Ben.\n“Big truck. Big job.\nBig kind heart.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "384bce77859deffc2b2242309ba98c4e4f6983e15847fd8c0c63ee774072a0ef",
      "text": "At home, his toy truck went\nwee-oo… wee-oo…\nThen quieter.\nThen… shhh.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0b1d65e87885efa1183ed3798f94c9cb55d25ab0146f63d7658cf0968e89bdc9",
      "text": "He tucked in his toy truck.\n“Goodnight, helpers.”\nThe whole room felt quiet.\nSo did he.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b94c8febe5feb6a7e982144d0c240be01010efc5f336537724b56e5cfcd50ae",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.",
